{% doc %}
  Tab Collection product list — tabbed product grid sourced from multiple
  Shopify collections via merchant-authored `spectrum_collection_tab`
  metaobjects.

  This snippet is invoked exclusively from the auto-generated per-instance
  wrapper produced by `packages/liquid-parser/src/snippet-instance-wrapper.ts`.
  The wrapper provides every parameter below; merchants never render this
  file directly.

  @param {Object} variant - The resolved default variant of the snippet
    instance. Read at `variant.content` for typed prop values (heading,
    description, collection_tabs ref-list marker, layout, etc.).
  @param {Object} mo - The `spectrum_snippet_instance` metaobject drop. The
    typed reference list field `mo.collection_tabs.value` carries the tab
    metaobjects; this snippet dereferences them via the Shopify global
    `metaobjects.spectrum_collection_tab[handle]` using the handles in
    `variant.content.collection_tabs.refIds`.
  @param {String} mutation_handle - Stable handle for this instance. Consumed
    by the wrapper outer div only; not read inside this snippet body.
  @param {String} experience_handle - Studio experience handle. Consumed by
    the wrapper outer div; not read inside this snippet body.
{% enddoc %}

{%- comment -%}
  Tab Collection product list — tabbed product grid.

  Wrapper contract (per docs/tech/studio-liquid-snippets.md "Library Snippets"
  + packages/liquid-parser/src/snippet-instance-wrapper.ts buildRenderBlock):
    - variant            default variant from mo.variants.value.variants
    - mo                 spectrum_snippet_instance metaobject drop
    - mutation_handle    consumed by wrapper outer div
    - experience_handle  consumed by wrapper outer div

  variant.content fields:
    - heading              string                section title
    - description          string                section description
    - data_source          'manual' | 'metafield'
                           manual: read tabs from collection_tabs (below);
                           metafield: read tabs from a merchant-pointed JSON
                           metafield on product (PDP) / collection
                           (collection page) / shop (otherwise)
    - collection_tabs      Array<TabItem>   (manual only)
                           authored inline in Studio drop dialog (inline-list).
                           Each TabItem: { title, subtitle?,
                             image?: { gid, originalUrl, previewUrl, fileName, kind },
                             collection: { gid, handle, title, productsCount } }
                           image / collection sub-objects are Shopify picker
                           output (Files / Collection picker) — fields captured
                           at write time; re-pick to refresh.
    - metafield_namespace  string                (metafield only)
    - metafield_key        string                (metafield only)
                           JSON metafield value shape:
                           [{ title, collection_handle, subtitle?, image_url? }]
    - tab_style            'pill' | 'underline' | 'image_circle' | 'card_stacked'
    - tab_align            'left' | 'center'
    - product_count        integer 1..24         how many products to render per tab
    - list_layout          'grid' | 'carousel' | 'list'
    - cards_per_row        { mobile, tablet?, desktop? } each integer 1..6 (mobile-first cascade)
    - progress_indicator   'none'|'scroll_bar'|'dots'|'stepper' (carousel only)
    - carousel_arrows      boolean        (carousel only)
    - image_aspect_ratio   '1/1' | '3/4' | '4/3'
    - image_object_fit     'cover' | 'contain'
    - image_mode           'single' | 'carousel'
    - show_image_dots      boolean
    - image_dots_position  'left' | 'center' | 'right'    placement of the image-carousel dot strip
    - title_lines          '1' | '2' | '3' | 'wrap'
    - show_price_label, show_current_price, show_mrp, show_discount, show_cta : booleans
    - price_label_text     string
    - cta_label            string
    - primary_cta_action   'add_to_cart' | 'buy_now' | 'toggle_wishlist' | 'share' | 'navigate_to_pdp'
                           drives the primary CTA click behaviour. JS reads
                           `data-spectrum-primary-action` on the rendered
                           `<a>` to route into the right handler.
    - enable_mini_pdp      boolean                        when true and the
                           primary action is cart-add or buy-now, the
                           Mini-PDP modal block renders for variant
                           selection on multi-variant products.
    - show_swatches        boolean
    - swatch_option_name   string                option name to source swatches from (case-insensitive)
    - swatch_max_visible   { mobile, tablet?, desktop? } 1..12, cap before "+N" overflow chip
    - swatch_shape         'circle' | 'square'

  Card structure
    <div .__card>                            ← shell, not interactive itself
      <a .__card-link href=PDP>              ← image + title + price area, click → PDP
        <div .__image-zone>                  ← aspect-ratio container
          <img .__image>     OR              ← image_mode = 'single'
          <div .__image-track>...slides...   ← image_mode = 'carousel'
        </div>
        <div .__body>
          <h3 .__title>
          <div .__price-block>
            [.__price-label] [.__price-current] [.__price-mrp] [.__price-discount]
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      [<a .__cta href=PDP>label</a>]         ← sibling so we don't nest <a> in <a>
      [<script application/json data-spectrum-atc-data>...</script>]  ← variant payload
    </div>

  Type-coercion gotcha: Liquid `==` is type-strict. `_item.id` is integer on
  product / collection drops; `content.collection.refId` is a string. Coerce
  ids via `| append: ''` before comparing.

  NOTE: do not write literal Liquid tag syntax in documentation text — the
  catalog import balance check rejects nested `comment` / `doc` / control tags.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% stylesheet %}
/* Featured Collection — aggregated into spectrum-snippet.css at install */

/* Container ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  font-family: var(--sai-font-body);
}

/* Heading + description.  Explicit font-size + color — many merchant themes
   reset bare <h2>/<p> to inherited or zero sizing via class-targeted rules
   (`.h2`, `.heading`, etc.). The `display: block !important` defends against
   themes that hide unclassed headings outright. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__heading {
  display: block !important;
  margin: 0 0 var(--sai-size-2);
  font-family: var(--sai-font-heading);
  font-style: var(--sai-font-heading-style);
  font-weight: var(--sai-font-heading-weight);
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  line-height: 1.3;
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
}

/* Title accent — responsive treatment.
   The accent (mobile underline / desktop vertical bar) attaches to an
   inline-block inner span so it shrinks to text width. The merchant's
   per-instance text-align on `.__heading` positions the span inside the
   full-width heading block. Color falls back to the heading's text color
   via currentColor when no override is set. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__heading[data-border-bottom="true"] .sai-tcm9wosw__heading-text {
  display: inline-block;
  padding-bottom: var(--sai-size-2);
  border-bottom: 3px solid
    var(--sai-tcm9wosw-heading-border-color, currentColor);
}

@media (min-width: 750px) {
  .sai-tcm9wosw__heading[data-border-bottom="true"] .sai-tcm9wosw__heading-text {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 0;
    padding-left: var(--sai-size-4);
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__heading[data-border-bottom="true"] .sai-tcm9wosw__heading-text::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.15em;
    bottom: 0.15em;
    width: 6px;
    background: var(--sai-tcm9wosw-heading-border-color, currentColor);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__description {
  margin: 0 0 var(--sai-size-5);
  font-family: var(--sai-font-body);
  font-style: var(--sai-font-body-style);
  font-weight: var(--sai-font-body-weight);
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
}

/* Section title asset — optional image alongside the heading. See
   v5vphgd8 for the full rationale; this is a byte-aligned fork. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__heading-row {
  display: flex !important;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--sai-size-3);
  margin: 0 0 var(--sai-size-2);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__heading-row .sai-tcm9wosw__heading {
  margin: 0;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__heading-row--right .sai-tcm9wosw__section-asset {
  order: 2;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__heading-row--size-sm { --sai-tcm9wosw-section-asset-px: 24px; }
.sai-tcm9wosw__heading-row--size-md { --sai-tcm9wosw-section-asset-px: 32px; }
.sai-tcm9wosw__heading-row--size-lg { --sai-tcm9wosw-section-asset-px: 48px; }
.sai-tcm9wosw__section-asset {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: var(--sai-tcm9wosw-section-asset-px, 32px);
  height: var(--sai-tcm9wosw-section-asset-px, 32px);
  object-fit: contain;
  display: block;
}

/* Tab strip ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

/* Rail. Horizontal-only; scrolls when chips overflow. `safe` keeps the
   first chip reachable when content overflows a centered container. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__tabs {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
  align-items: center;
  margin: 0 0 var(--sai-size-4);
  padding: 0;
  overflow-x: auto;
  overflow-y: hidden;
  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
  scrollbar-width: none;
  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tabs::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none }
.sai-tcm9wosw__tabs[data-tab-align="center"] {
  justify-content: safe center;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tabs[data-tab-align="left"] {
  justify-content: flex-start;
}

/* Chip — base. The button reset is intentional: every theme has its own
   button styling and we don't want it leaking into the chip surface. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  scroll-snap-align: start;
  display: inline-flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 2px;
  padding: var(--sai-size-2) var(--sai-size-4);
  background: transparent;
  border: 0;
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  font-family: var(--sai-font-body);
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  line-height: 1.2;
  cursor: pointer;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--sai-color-fg);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

/* Wraps title (+ optional subtitle) so they sit as a vertical text
   stack independent of the outer button's flex direction (pill+image
   uses row, pill-only and image_circle use column). */
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab-text {
  display: inline-flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: inherit;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 0;
  min-width: 0;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab-title {
  font-weight: 600;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab-subtitle {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: var(--sai-color-fg-muted, var(--sai-color-fg));
  opacity: 0.7;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* Style: pill — rounded surface, accent fill on active. The active background
   reads from `--sai-tcm9wosw-tab-active` (set by the merchant's
   `tab_active_color` prop on the tab-strip wrapper) and falls back to the
   theme's primary, then foreground. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--pill {
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--sai-color-bg-subtle, transparent);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--pill.is-active {
  background: var(--sai-tcm9wosw-tab-active, var(--sai-color-primary, var(--sai-color-fg)));
  color: var(--sai-color-bg);
}

/* Pill + image — row layout with a small image on the left and the title
   stack on the right. The image is intentionally smaller than the
   image_circle variant (32px vs 64px) because it sits inline with the
   title at button-height scale. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--pill.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--has-image {
  flex-direction: row;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
  padding: 4px var(--sai-size-3) 4px 4px;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--pill .sai-tcm9wosw__tab-image-frame {
  /* Tighter gap between image edge and ring in pill mode — the chip's
     pill border-radius already provides visual containment, so the
     ring offset can be slimmer. */
  padding: 2px;
  border-width: 2px;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--pill .sai-tcm9wosw__tab-image {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
}
/* Inside an active pill, suppress the image ring — the pill's filled
   background is the active indicator; a separate ring fights it. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--pill.is-active .sai-tcm9wosw__tab-image-frame {
  border-color: transparent !important;
}

/* Style: underline — text-only with a single-line rule under active.
   The 2px rule sits inside the chip's bottom padding so its width tracks
   the title rather than the chip's outer padding. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--underline {
  padding-block: var(--sai-size-2);
  padding-inline: var(--sai-size-3);
  border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
  color: var(--sai-color-fg-muted, var(--sai-color-fg));
  opacity: 0.6;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--underline.is-active {
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  opacity: 1;
  border-bottom-color: var(--sai-tcm9wosw-tab-active, var(--sai-color-primary, var(--sai-color-fg)));
}

/* Style: image_circle — column layout with a circular thumb above the
   title. Active state adds a ring around the image. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--image_circle {
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--image_circle .sai-tcm9wosw__tab-title {
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--sai-color-fg-muted, var(--sai-color-fg));
  opacity: 0.7;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--image_circle.is-active .sai-tcm9wosw__tab-title {
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  opacity: 1;
}
/* Frido-style offset ring on the active image. Two layers:
   - `__tab-image-frame` (outer) — hosts the ring + the gap. Padding
      creates the visible gap between image and ring; border is the
      ring (transparent until active). Reserves layout space in both
      states so there's no jump on activate.
   - `__tab-image` (inner) — circular crop with `overflow: hidden`,
      holds the actual image. One element can't carry both a clipped
      inner image AND an offset outer border; that's why the wrapper
      exists.
   The visible ring sits 3px outside the image edge — matches the
   Frido "Essentials" reference exactly. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab-image-frame {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 3px;
  border-radius: var(--sai-tcm9wosw-image-radius, 50%);
  border: 3px solid transparent;
  box-sizing: content-box;
  transition: border-color 120ms ease;
  background: transparent;
  line-height: 0;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab-image {
  display: block;
  width: 64px;
  height: 64px;
  border-radius: var(--sai-tcm9wosw-image-radius, 50%);
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--sai-color-bg-subtle, transparent);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab-image img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border: 0 !important;
  border-radius: var(--sai-tcm9wosw-image-radius, 50%);
  object-fit: cover;
}
/* Active ring — `!important` and a hardcoded `#f5c518` (Frido yellow)
   as the final fallback are intentional. The accent resolution chain
   is:
     tab_active_color  →  --sai-color-primary  →  #f5c518
   so even on a stripped-down theme that defines none of the design
   tokens, the ring shows the Frido reference yellow. `!important`
   defeats theme rules that hard-set `border-color: transparent` on
   inner spans. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--image_circle.is-active .sai-tcm9wosw__tab-image-frame {
  border-color: var(--sai-tcm9wosw-tab-active, var(--sai-color-primary, #f5c518)) !important;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab-image img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
}

/* Style: card_stacked — square-ish card with image stacked above the
   title. Inactive cards are a neutral surface with a hairline border;
   active card fills with `--sai-tcm9wosw-tab-active` (merchant accent →
   theme primary → foreground) and flips icon + text to the on-primary
   contrast color. The image frame ring is suppressed in this style —
   the card's filled background is the active indicator. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--card_stacked {
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
  min-width: 132px;
  min-height: 132px;
  padding: var(--sai-size-3);
  background: var(--sai-color-bg, #fff);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 12%, transparent);
  border-radius: var(--sai-radius-lg);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  transition: background-color 120ms ease, color 120ms ease, border-color 120ms ease;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--card_stacked .sai-tcm9wosw__tab-image-frame {
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  background: transparent;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--card_stacked .sai-tcm9wosw__tab-image {
  width: 56px;
  height: 56px;
  border-radius: 0;
  background: transparent;
  overflow: visible;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--card_stacked .sai-tcm9wosw__tab-image img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: 0;
  object-fit: contain;
  background: transparent;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--card_stacked .sai-tcm9wosw__tab-title {
  font-weight: 600;
  white-space: normal;
  text-align: center;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--card_stacked .sai-tcm9wosw__tab-subtitle {
  white-space: normal;
  text-align: center;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--card_stacked.is-active {
  background: var(--sai-tcm9wosw-tab-active, var(--sai-color-primary, var(--sai-color-fg)));
  border-color: var(--sai-tcm9wosw-tab-active, var(--sai-color-primary, var(--sai-color-fg)));
  color: var(--sai-color-primary-fg, var(--sai-color-bg, #fff));
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tab--card_stacked.is-active .sai-tcm9wosw__tab-image-frame {
  border-color: transparent !important;
}

/* Panel — inactive panels still render so each panel's carousels /
   swatches / mini-PDP wiring initialise eagerly; visibility flips via
   the `hidden` attribute toggled by JS. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__panel {
  display: block;
}
/* Hide inactive panels. `!important` is intentional: every Shopify theme
   has its own opinions about `[hidden]` (Dawn, Prestige, and most theme
   frameworks ship rules that override the browser UA `[hidden] { display:
   none }` for layout-overflow or accessibility-fallback reasons), so a
   defensive non-author-overrideable rule is the only way to guarantee
   inactive tab panels stay hidden. Scope is tight — only `__panel` with
   `hidden` — so this doesn't bleed into anything else. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__panel[hidden] {
  display: none !important;
}

/* Layout wrapper. Carousel mode: stacks the carousel frame above the
   indicator strip. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__layout {
  display: block;
}

/* View-all CTA — pill button below the per-tab grid. Centered by default;
   merchant can re-skin via the `view_all_button` Styling node. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__view-all {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-top: var(--sai-size-4);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__view-all-link {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
  padding: var(--sai-size-2) var(--sai-size-5);
  border: 1px solid var(--sai-color-fg);
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  font-family: var(--sai-font-body);
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.2;
  text-decoration: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background-color 120ms ease, color 120ms ease;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__view-all-link:hover {
  background: var(--sai-color-fg);
  color: var(--sai-color-bg);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__view-all-link:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--sai-color-fg);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__view-all-icon {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

/* Carousel frame — wraps the scroller + arrows. Provides the positioning
   context that the absolutely-positioned arrows need so they sit centred
   over the carousel itself, not over the indicator strip below. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__frame {
  position: relative;
}

/* Grid (default) ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
/* Cards-per-row reads three viewport-keyed CSS vars set inline on this
 * element by the Liquid template (`--sai-tcm9wosw-cpr-m/-t/-d`). Mobile is
 * the base (no media query); tablet and desktop overrides kick in at the
 * same Dawn-aligned breakpoints used by the rest of this snippet's static
 * styles (750 / 990). */
.sai-tcm9wosw__grid--grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--sai-tcm9wosw-cpr-m, 2), 1fr);
  gap: var(--sai-size-4);
}

@media (min-width: 750px) {
  .sai-tcm9wosw__grid--grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--sai-tcm9wosw-cpr-t, 3), 1fr);
  }
}

@media (min-width: 990px) {
  .sai-tcm9wosw__grid--grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--sai-tcm9wosw-cpr-d, 4), 1fr);
  }
}

/* Carousel ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw__grid--carousel {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row;
  gap: var(--sai-size-4);
  overflow-x: auto;
  overflow-y: hidden;
  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  scrollbar-width: none;
  -ms-overflow-style: none;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__grid--carousel::-webkit-scrollbar {
  display: none;
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__grid--carousel > .sai-tcm9wosw__card {
  flex: 0 0
    calc(
      (100% - (var(--sai-tcm9wosw-cpr-m, 2) - 1) * var(--sai-size-4)) /
      var(--sai-tcm9wosw-cpr-m, 2)
    );
  scroll-snap-align: start;
  scroll-snap-stop: always;
}

@media (min-width: 750px) {
  .sai-tcm9wosw__grid--carousel > .sai-tcm9wosw__card {
    flex: 0 0
      calc(
        (100% - (var(--sai-tcm9wosw-cpr-t, 3) - 1) * var(--sai-size-4)) /
        var(--sai-tcm9wosw-cpr-t, 3)
      );
  }
}

@media (min-width: 990px) {
  .sai-tcm9wosw__grid--carousel > .sai-tcm9wosw__card {
    flex: 0 0
      calc(
        (100% - (var(--sai-tcm9wosw-cpr-d, 4) - 1) * var(--sai-size-4)) /
        var(--sai-tcm9wosw-cpr-d, 4)
      );
  }
}

/* List ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw__grid--list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--sai-size-4);
}

/* Carousel controls ────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw__controls {
  margin-top: var(--sai-size-3);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: var(--sai-size-3);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__arrow {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  display: none;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  padding: 0;
  background: var(--sai-color-bg);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 12%, transparent);
  border-radius: 999px;
  box-shadow: var(--sai-shadow-1);
  cursor: pointer;
  z-index: 2;
  transition: opacity var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__arrow svg {
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__arrow--prev {
  left: var(--sai-size-2);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__arrow--next {
  right: var(--sai-size-2);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__arrow:disabled,
.sai-tcm9wosw__arrow[aria-disabled="true"] {
  opacity: 0.4;
  cursor: default;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__arrow:hover:not(:disabled) {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-bg) 92%, var(--sai-color-fg));
}

@media (min-width: 750px) {
  .sai-tcm9wosw__layout--carousel .sai-tcm9wosw__arrow {
    display: inline-flex;
  }
}

/* Page-level dots ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw__dots {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
  padding: 0;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__dot {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  padding: 0;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 25%, transparent);
  border: none;
  border-radius: 999px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1), transform
    var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__dot.is-active {
  background: var(--sai-color-fg);
  transform: scale(1.3);
}

/* Scroll bar ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw__scrollbar {
  position: relative;
  width: min(240px, 60%);
  height: 3px;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 12%, transparent);
  border-radius: 999px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__scrollbar-thumb {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  height: 100%;
  width: 25%;
  background: var(--sai-color-fg);
  border-radius: 999px;
  transform: translateX(0%);
  transition: transform var(--sai-duration-2) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}

/* Stepper ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw__stepper {
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 70%, transparent);
}

/* Card shell ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw__card {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  /* Cards in the same grid row stretch to equal height via CSS Grid's default
     align-items: stretch. `justify-content: space-between` pushes the CTA to
     the card's bottom edge so a card with a short title doesn't end up with
     its ATC button floating mid-card next to siblings with longer titles. */
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--sai-size-3);
  padding: var(--sai-size-3);
  background: transparent;
  border-radius: var(--sai-radius-lg);
  /* Positioned so absolute-positioned descendants (e.g. the tertiary CTA)
     anchor to the card at rest. Without this, they'd only snap into place
     during :hover when `transform` creates a temporary containing block. */
  position: relative;
  transition: box-shadow var(--sai-duration-2) var(--sai-ease-out-1), transform
    var(--sai-duration-2) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}

/* Hover lift — gated by the `card_hover_shadow` prop (default on).
   When off, the card stays flat on hover. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__card[data-hover-shadow="true"]:hover {
  box-shadow: var(--sai-shadow-2);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

/* Hover image swap — second image overlays the featured image with
   opacity 0, fades in on hover. Only rendered (and only swaps) when
   `card_hover_swap_image` is on AND the product has a second image. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__image--hover {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity var(--sai-duration-2, 250ms) var(--sai-ease-out-1, ease-out);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__image-zone {
  position: relative;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__card[data-hover-swap="true"]:hover .sai-tcm9wosw__image--hover {
  opacity: 1;
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__card-link {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--sai-size-3);
  text-decoration: none;
  color: inherit;
}

/* Image zone ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw__image-zone {
  position: relative;
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: var(--sai-radius-md);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 6%, transparent);
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__image {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  transition: transform var(--sai-duration-3) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__card:hover .sai-tcm9wosw__image {
  transform: scale(1.03);
}

/* Per-card image carousel ─────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw__image-zone--carousel {
  position: relative;
  padding: 0;
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__image-track {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  overflow-x: auto;
  overflow-y: hidden;
  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  scrollbar-width: none;
  -ms-overflow-style: none;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__image-track::-webkit-scrollbar {
  display: none;
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__image-slide {
  position: relative;
  flex: 0 0 100%;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  scroll-snap-align: start;
  scroll-snap-stop: always;
}

/* Disable card-level hover zoom in carousel mode — fights swipe. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__card:hover .sai-tcm9wosw__image-zone--carousel .sai-tcm9wosw__image {
  transform: none;
}

/* Image dots — `data-position` is set by the snippet from the
 * `image_dots_position` prop. Default (center) keeps the existing
 * 50%/translateX strategy; left/right anchor to the same inset and
 * drop the centering transform. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__image-dots {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: var(--sai-size-2);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  padding: 4px 8px;
  background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.35);
  border-radius: 999px;
  pointer-events: auto;
  z-index: 1;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__image-dots[data-position="left"] {
  left: var(--sai-size-2);
  right: auto;
  transform: none;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__image-dots[data-position="right"] {
  left: auto;
  right: var(--sai-size-2);
  transform: none;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__image-dot {
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  padding: 0;
  background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.55);
  border: none;
  border-radius: 999px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1), transform
    var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__image-dot.is-active {
  background: #fff;
  transform: scale(1.35);
}

/* Body ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw__body {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__title {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--sai-font-body);
  font-weight: var(--sai-font-body-weight);
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  line-height: 1.35;
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  display: -webkit-box !important;
  -webkit-box-orient: vertical !important;
  -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
  overflow: hidden !important;
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__title[data-title-lines="1"] {
  -webkit-line-clamp: 1;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__title[data-title-lines="2"] {
  -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__title[data-title-lines="3"] {
  -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__title[data-title-lines="wrap"] {
  display: block !important;
  overflow: visible !important;
  -webkit-line-clamp: unset;
}

/* Title row — used when rating is on AND positioned to the right of the
   title. The title keeps its line-clamp + ellipsis (allowed to shrink),
   the rating cluster stays its natural width. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__title-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
  width: 100%;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__title-row .sai-tcm9wosw__title {
  min-width: 0;
  flex: 1 1 auto;
}

/* Product rating cluster — single star icon + numeric average. The star is
   sized in em so per-instance typography category resizes it cleanly. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__rating {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.25em;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  font-family: var(--sai-font-body);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1;
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 65%, transparent);
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__rating-star {
  display: block;
  width: 1em;
  height: 1em;
  /* The star inherits text color by default; a custom rating color set via
     the per-instance styler colors both the star and the text together. */
  color: #f5a623;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__rating-value,
.sai-tcm9wosw__rating-count {
  color: inherit;
}

/* Swatches ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── *
 * Per-viewport visibility is driven by `data-hide-m/-t/-d`
 * attributes baked at render time. Mobile is the base (those with
 * `data-hide-m` are hidden on mobile); tablet and desktop overrides
 * use the same Dawn-aligned 750 / 990 breakpoints as the rest of
 * this snippet's static CSS. The three `--m/-t/-d` overflow chips
 * are independently gated so only the active viewport's chip shows. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__swatches {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: nowrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
  margin-top: var(--sai-size-1);
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__swatch {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 8%, var(--sai-color-bg));
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 18%, transparent);
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__swatches--circle .sai-tcm9wosw__swatch {
  border-radius: 999px;
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__swatches--square .sai-tcm9wosw__swatch {
  border-radius: 2px;
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__swatch-more {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  min-width: 18px;
  padding: 0 4px;
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 1;
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 70%, transparent);
  border-radius: 999px;
  background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 8%, var(--sai-color-bg));
}

/* Per-viewport gating. Mobile is the base — `data-hide-m` swatches and the
 * tablet/desktop overflow chips are hidden by default. Each `@media` block
 * un-hides the next viewport's set and hides the previous viewport's chip. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__swatch[data-hide-m],
.sai-tcm9wosw__swatch-more--t,
.sai-tcm9wosw__swatch-more--d {
  display: none;
}

@media (min-width: 750px) {
  .sai-tcm9wosw__swatch[data-hide-m] {
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__swatch[data-hide-t] {
    display: none;
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__swatch-more--m {
    display: none;
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__swatch-more--t {
    display: inline-flex;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 990px) {
  .sai-tcm9wosw__swatch[data-hide-t] {
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__swatch[data-hide-d] {
    display: none;
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__swatch-more--t {
    display: none;
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__swatch-more--d {
    display: inline-flex;
  }
}

/* Price block ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw__price-block {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--sai-size-1);
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__price-label {
  font-size: 0.6875rem;
  line-height: 1.3;
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 60%, transparent);
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__price-row {
  display: inline-flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
  align-items: baseline;
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__price-current {
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: var(--sai-font-body-weight-bold);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__price-mrp {
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 50%, transparent);
  text-decoration: line-through;
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__price-discount {
  font-size: 0.6875rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--sai-color-error, #1d9e75);
  padding: 0;
  background: transparent;
  border-radius: var(--sai-radius-sm);
}

/* CTA ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw__cta {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 100%;
  padding: var(--sai-size-2) var(--sai-size-3);
  font-family: var(--sai-font-body);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-align: center;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: var(--sai-color-primary-fg);
  background: var(--sai-color-primary);
  border: none;
  border-radius: var(--sai-radius-md);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}

/* Selector chained intentionally to (0,4,0) so it beats per-instance baked
   styles `[data-spectrum-instance-id][data-spectrum-variant-id] .__cta`
   (0,3,0). Without this bump, a merchant who set a per-instance CTA
   background would never see the hover-color override fire. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__card .sai-tcm9wosw__cta.sai-tcm9wosw__cta:hover,
.sai-tcm9wosw__card .sai-tcm9wosw__cta.sai-tcm9wosw__cta:focus-visible {
  background: var(
    --sai-tcm9wosw-cta-hover-bg,
    color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-primary) 88%, var(--sai-color-fg))
  );
  color: var(--sai-tcm9wosw-cta-hover-fg, var(--sai-color-primary-fg));
}

/* Sold-out: every variant on this product returned `available: false`.
   The JS swaps the label to the merchant-configured sold-out copy and adds
   `is-soldout` + `aria-disabled`.  Dimmed, no hover affordance, no clicks. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__cta.is-soldout,
.sai-tcm9wosw__cta[aria-disabled="true"] {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 14%, var(--sai-color-bg));
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 55%, transparent);
  cursor: not-allowed;
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   Secondary + Tertiary CTAs — byte-aligned with v5vphgd8.
   ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw__cta-row {
  display: flex !important;
  align-items: stretch;
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__cta-row .sai-tcm9wosw__cta {
  flex: 1 1 auto;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__secondary-cta {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 1px solid var(--sai-color-border, color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 20%, transparent));
  background: var(--sai-color-bg);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  border-radius: var(--sai-radius-md);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__secondary-cta:hover,
.sai-tcm9wosw__secondary-cta:focus-visible {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 6%, var(--sai-color-bg));
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__secondary-cta--icon {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: 40px;
  padding: 0;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__secondary-cta--text-below {
  width: 100%;
  margin-top: var(--sai-size-2);
  padding: var(--sai-size-2) var(--sai-size-3);
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
  font-family: var(--sai-font-body);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-weight: 500;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__secondary-cta.is-wishlisted {
  color: var(--sai-color-primary, var(--sai-color-fg));
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__secondary-cta-label {
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__tertiary-cta {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 3;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  padding: 0;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 12%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-bg) 88%, transparent);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  cursor: pointer;
  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  transition:
    background var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1),
    transform var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tertiary-cta:hover,
.sai-tcm9wosw__tertiary-cta:focus-visible {
  background: var(--sai-tcm9wosw-tertiary-hover-bg, var(--sai-color-bg));
  color: var(--sai-tcm9wosw-tertiary-hover-fg, var(--sai-color-fg));
  transform: scale(1.05);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tertiary-cta.is-wishlisted {
  color: var(--sai-color-primary, var(--sai-color-fg));
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tertiary-cta--image-top-right {
  top: var(--sai-size-3);
  right: var(--sai-size-3);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__card[data-image-aspect="1/1"] .sai-tcm9wosw__tertiary-cta--image-bottom-right {
  top: calc(100% / 1 - 36px - var(--sai-size-3));
  right: var(--sai-size-3);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__card[data-image-aspect="3/4"] .sai-tcm9wosw__tertiary-cta--image-bottom-right {
  top: calc(100% / 0.75 - 36px - var(--sai-size-3));
  right: var(--sai-size-3);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__card[data-image-aspect="4/3"] .sai-tcm9wosw__tertiary-cta--image-bottom-right {
  top: calc(100% * 0.75 - 36px - var(--sai-size-3));
  right: var(--sai-size-3);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__tertiary-cta--title-right {
  top: calc(100% + var(--sai-size-2));
  right: var(--sai-size-2);
}

/* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   Mini-PDP — full quick-view modal
   Mobile (< 750px): bottom sheet.  Desktop: centred modal.
   ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 9999;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: center;
  font-family: var(--sai-font-body);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp[hidden] {
  display: none;
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-backdrop {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.5);
  animation: sai-tcm9wosw-fade-in var(--sai-duration-2) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-panel {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  width: 100%;
  max-height: 92vh;
  overflow-y: auto;
  background: var(--sai-color-bg);
  border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;
  box-shadow: 0 -8px 32px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.18);
  animation: sai-tcm9wosw-slide-up var(--sai-duration-2) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--radius-sharp .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-panel {
  border-radius: 0;
}

@media (min-width: 750px) {
  .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp {
    align-items: center;
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-panel {
    max-height: 88vh;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 48px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.24);
    animation: sai-tcm9wosw-fade-in var(--sai-duration-2) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--radius-sharp .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-panel {
    border-radius: 0;
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--width-sm .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-panel {
    width: min(640px, 92vw);
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--width-md .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-panel {
    width: min(880px, 92vw);
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--width-lg .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-panel {
    width: min(1080px, 92vw);
  }
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-close {
  position: absolute;
  top: var(--sai-size-3);
  right: var(--sai-size-3);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  padding: 0;
  background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.9);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 12%, transparent);
  border-radius: 999px;
  cursor: pointer;
  z-index: 3;
  transition: background var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-close svg {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-close:hover {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-bg) 90%, var(--sai-color-fg));
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-layout {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
@media (min-width: 750px) {
  .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-carousel .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-layout {
    flex-direction: row;
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-carousel .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-gallery {
    flex: 1 1 50%;
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-carousel .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-content {
    flex: 1 1 50%;
  }
}

/* Gallery */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-gallery {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 5%, transparent);
  overflow: hidden;
}
/* List-mode (compact thumbnail) gallery — Frido-style header layout:
   square thumbnail on the left, title + price on the right; secondary
   content (variants / low stock / qty / description / CTAs) flows below
   full-width. CSS Grid with `display: contents` on the inner content
   wrapper lets us project all the children onto the grid as siblings of
   the gallery so we can place each precisely while keeping the existing
   Liquid markup. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr;
  align-items: start;
  column-gap: var(--sai-size-4);
  row-gap: var(--sai-size-3);
  padding: var(--sai-size-4);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-gallery {
  width: 140px;
  height: 140px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  margin: 0;
  grid-column: 1;
  grid-row: 1 / span 2;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-content {
  display: contents;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-title {
  grid-column: 2;
  grid-row: 1;
  margin: 0;
  min-width: 0;
  font-family: var(--sai-font-body);
  font-size: 1.0625rem;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-price-row {
  grid-column: 2;
  grid-row: 2;
  margin: 0;
  min-width: 0;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variants,
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-low-stock,
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-qty,
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-description,
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-ctas {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
  margin: 0;
  min-width: 0;
}
@media (min-width: 750px) {
  .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-layout {
    grid-template-columns: 160px 1fr;
  }
  .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-gallery {
    width: 160px;
    height: 160px;
  }
}

/* Discount badge → pastel-green pill on its own line below the price. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-discount {
  flex-basis: 100%;
  align-self: flex-start;
  margin-top: 6px;
  padding: 4px 12px;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-error, #1d9e75) 18%, transparent);
  color: var(--sai-color-error, #1d9e75);
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* List mode: keep the CTAs as a 2-up row (Add To Cart + Buy Now) at
   equal widths so the full-width CTA strip below the thumbnail reads as a
   single primary action row, not stacked buttons. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-ctas {
  flex-direction: row;
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-ctas > * {
  flex: 1 1 0;
  min-width: 0;
}

.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-track {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  overflow-x: auto;
  overflow-y: hidden;
  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  scrollbar-width: none;
  -ms-overflow-style: none;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-track::-webkit-scrollbar {
  display: none;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-slide {
  position: relative;
  flex: 0 0 100%;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  scroll-snap-align: start;
  scroll-snap-stop: always;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-slide img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
}

/* Chevrons */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-chevron {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  padding: 0;
  background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.92);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 12%, transparent);
  border-radius: 999px;
  box-shadow: var(--sai-shadow-1);
  cursor: pointer;
  z-index: 2;
  transition: opacity var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-chevron[hidden] {
  display: none;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-chevron svg {
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-chevron--prev {
  left: var(--sai-size-3);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-chevron--next {
  right: var(--sai-size-3);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-chevron:disabled,
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-chevron[aria-disabled="true"] {
  opacity: 0.4;
  cursor: default;
}

/* Pagination dots */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-dots {
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: var(--sai-size-3);
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  padding: 4px 8px;
  background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.4);
  border-radius: 999px;
  z-index: 1;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-dots[hidden] {
  display: none;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-dot {
  width: 7px;
  height: 7px;
  padding: 0;
  background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.55);
  border: none;
  border-radius: 999px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1), transform
    var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-dot.is-active {
  background: #fff;
  transform: scale(1.35);
}

/* Overlay actions */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-overlay-actions {
  position: absolute;
  top: var(--sai-size-3);
  right: var(--sai-size-3);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
  z-index: 2;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-list .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-overlay-actions {
  display: none;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-share,
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-view-product {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  padding: 0;
  background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.92);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 12%, transparent);
  border-radius: 999px;
  cursor: pointer;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: background var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-share svg,
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-view-product svg {
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-share:hover,
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-view-product:hover {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-bg) 88%, var(--sai-color-fg));
}

/* Content zone */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-content {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--sai-size-3);
  padding: var(--sai-size-4) var(--sai-size-4) var(--sai-size-5);
}
@media (min-width: 750px) {
  .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-carousel .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-content {
    padding: var(--sai-size-5) var(--sai-size-5);
    overflow-y: auto;
  }
}

/* Price row */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-price-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-price-current {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: var(--sai-font-body-weight-bold);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-price-mrp[hidden] {
  display: none;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-price-mrp {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 50%, transparent);
  text-decoration: line-through;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-discount[hidden] {
  display: none;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-discount {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--sai-color-error, #1d9e75);
  padding: 2px 6px;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-error, #1d9e75) 12%, transparent);
  border-radius: var(--sai-radius-sm);
}

/* Title */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-title {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--sai-font-heading);
  font-style: var(--sai-font-heading-style);
  font-weight: var(--sai-font-heading-weight);
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  line-height: 1.3;
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
}
@media (min-width: 750px) {
  .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-carousel .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
}

/* Variant selector */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variants {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--sai-size-2);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variants--dropdown {
  display: block;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variants--pill .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variant {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
  min-height: 38px;
  padding: 6px 14px;
  background: var(--sai-color-bg);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 18%, transparent);
  border-radius: 999px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: border-color var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1), background
    var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variants--pill .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variant.is-selected {
  border-color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 4%, transparent);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variants--pill .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variant:disabled,
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variants--pill .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variant[aria-disabled="true"] {
  opacity: 0.45;
  cursor: not-allowed;
  text-decoration: line-through;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variants--swatch .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variant {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  min-width: 44px;
  min-height: 44px;
  padding: 6px 10px;
  background: var(--sai-color-bg);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 18%, transparent);
  border-radius: var(--sai-radius-sm);
  cursor: pointer;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variants--swatch .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variant.is-selected {
  border-color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 4%, transparent);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variants--swatch .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variant:disabled {
  opacity: 0.45;
  cursor: not-allowed;
  text-decoration: line-through;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variants--dropdown select {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 10px 12px;
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  background: var(--sai-color-bg);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 18%, transparent);
  border-radius: var(--sai-radius-md);
  cursor: pointer;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-variant-price {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 60%, transparent);
}

/* Low inventory */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-low-stock[hidden] {
  display: none;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-low-stock {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--sai-color-error, #d23f3f);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-low-stock svg {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* Quantity */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-qty {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--sai-size-3);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-qty-label {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-qty-stepper {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 18%, transparent);
  border-radius: var(--sai-radius-md);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-qty-button {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  padding: 0;
  background: var(--sai-color-bg);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  border: none;
  font-size: 1rem;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-qty-button:hover {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 6%, transparent);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-qty-input {
  width: 44px;
  height: 36px;
  padding: 0;
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-align: center;
  background: var(--sai-color-bg);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  border: none;
  border-left: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 18%, transparent);
  border-right: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 18%, transparent);
  -moz-appearance: textfield;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-qty-input::-webkit-outer-spin-button,
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-qty-input::-webkit-inner-spin-button {
  -webkit-appearance: none;
  margin: 0;
}

/* Description */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-description--font-sm .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-description-body {
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-description--font-md .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-description-body {
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  line-height: 1.55;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-description-body {
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 80%, transparent);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-description--compact .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-description-body {
  display: -webkit-box;
  -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
  -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-description--expandable.is-collapsed .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-description-body {
  display: -webkit-box;
  -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
  -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-description-toggle[hidden] {
  display: none;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-description-toggle {
  margin-top: 4px;
  padding: 0;
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  cursor: pointer;
  text-decoration: underline;
}

/* CTA buttons */
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-ctas {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--sai-size-3);
  margin-top: auto;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-ctas--side_by_side {
  flex-direction: row;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-ctas--side_by_side > * {
  flex: 1 1 0;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-ctas--stacked {
  flex-direction: column;
}
@media (min-width: 750px) {
  .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp--gallery-carousel .sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-ctas {
    margin-top: var(--sai-size-4);
  }
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-atc,
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-buy-now {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 14px 20px;
  font-family: var(--sai-font-body);
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  border-radius: var(--sai-radius-md);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background var(--sai-duration-1) var(--sai-ease-out-1);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-atc {
  background: var(--sai-color-primary);
  color: var(--sai-color-primary-fg);
  border: 1px solid var(--sai-color-primary);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-atc:hover:not(:disabled) {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-primary) 88%, var(--sai-color-fg));
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-atc:disabled,
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-buy-now:disabled {
  opacity: 0.5;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-buy-now {
  background: var(--sai-color-bg);
  color: var(--sai-color-fg);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 35%, transparent);
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-buy-now:hover:not(:disabled) {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sai-color-fg) 4%, transparent);
}

/* Loading state — buttons that fire async cart writes set `aria-busy="true"`
   while the request is in flight.  The label fades to transparent and a
   rotating spinner overlays the center so the button stays clickable size
   without text-jump. */
.sai-tcm9wosw__cta[aria-busy="true"],
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-atc[aria-busy="true"],
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-buy-now[aria-busy="true"] {
  color: transparent !important;
  pointer-events: none;
  position: relative;
  opacity: 1 !important;
  cursor: progress !important;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__cta[aria-busy="true"]::after,
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-atc[aria-busy="true"]::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 50%;
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  margin: -9px 0 0 -9px;
  border: 2.5px solid var(--sai-color-primary-fg);
  border-top-color: transparent;
  border-radius: 50%;
  opacity: 1;
  animation: sai-tcm9wosw-spin 0.7s linear infinite;
}
.sai-tcm9wosw__pdp-buy-now[aria-busy="true"]::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 50%;
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  margin: -9px 0 0 -9px;
  border: 2.5px solid var(--sai-color-fg);
  border-top-color: transparent;
  border-radius: 50%;
  opacity: 1;
  animation: sai-tcm9wosw-spin 0.7s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes sai-tcm9wosw-spin {
  to {
    transform: rotate(360deg);
  }
}

@keyframes sai-tcm9wosw-fade-in {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
  }
}
@keyframes sai-tcm9wosw-slide-up {
  from {
    transform: translateY(100%);
  }
  to {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

.sai-tcm9wosw-body-locked {
  overflow: hidden !important;
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{%- assign content = variant.content -%}
{%- assign heading = content.heading | default: '' -%}
{%- assign description = content.description | default: '' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Section title asset — optional image rendered next to the heading.
  Position + size apply only when the asset object resolves to a usable
  URL; the renderer below falls back to plain heading if not. Size enum
  drives the `--sai-tcm9wosw-section-asset-px` custom property that
  CSS reads (24 / 32 / 48 px).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign section_asset_url = '' -%}
{%- if content.section_asset and content.section_asset.originalUrl -%}
  {%- assign section_asset_url = content.section_asset.originalUrl -%}
{%- elsif content.section_asset and content.section_asset.previewUrl -%}
  {%- assign section_asset_url = content.section_asset.previewUrl -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Heading underline — opt-in border below the title text. Color falls back
  to the heading's text color (currentColor) when no override is set.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if content.heading_border_bottom == nil -%}
  {%- assign heading_border_bottom = false -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign heading_border_bottom = content.heading_border_bottom -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign heading_border_color = content.heading_border_color | default: '' -%}
{%- capture heading_border_attr -%}
  {%- if heading_border_bottom %} data-border-bottom="true"
    {%- if heading_border_color != blank %} style="--sai-tcm9wosw-heading-border-color: {{ heading_border_color }};"{%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- assign section_asset_position = content.section_asset_position | default: 'left' -%}
{%- unless section_asset_position == 'left' or section_asset_position == 'right' -%}
  {%- assign section_asset_position = 'left' -%}
{%- endunless -%}

{%- assign section_asset_size = content.section_asset_size | default: 'md' -%}
{%- unless section_asset_size == 'sm' or section_asset_size == 'md' or section_asset_size == 'lg' -%}
  {%- assign section_asset_size = 'md' -%}
{%- endunless -%}

{%- comment -%}── Layout mode: whitelist, default grid ──{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign layout = content.list_layout | default: 'grid' -%}
{%- unless layout == 'grid' or layout == 'carousel' or layout == 'list' -%}
  {%- assign layout = 'grid' -%}
{%- endunless -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Cards-per-row: viewport-keyed object `{ mobile, tablet?, desktop? }`. Mobile
  is the cascade base. Each slot clamps to 1..6 with sensible defaults; tablet
  and desktop fall back to the next-smaller viewport when unset so authors can
  set one value and let the cascade flow.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign cpr_raw = content.cards_per_row -%}
{%- assign cpr_m = cpr_raw.mobile -%}
{%- assign cpr_t = cpr_raw.tablet -%}
{%- assign cpr_d = cpr_raw.desktop -%}
{%- if cpr_m == nil or cpr_m == blank -%}{%- assign cpr_m = 2 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if cpr_t == nil or cpr_t == blank -%}{%- assign cpr_t = cpr_m -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if cpr_d == nil or cpr_d == blank -%}{%- assign cpr_d = cpr_t -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if cpr_m < 1 -%}{%- assign cpr_m = 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if cpr_m > 6 -%}{%- assign cpr_m = 6 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if cpr_t < 1 -%}{%- assign cpr_t = 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if cpr_t > 6 -%}{%- assign cpr_t = 6 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if cpr_d < 1 -%}{%- assign cpr_d = 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if cpr_d > 6 -%}{%- assign cpr_d = 6 -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}── Product count: clamp to 1..24, default 8 ──{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign product_count = content.product_count -%}
{%- if product_count == nil or product_count == blank -%}
  {%- assign product_count = 8 -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if product_count < 1 -%}{%- assign product_count = 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if product_count > 24 -%}{%- assign product_count = 24 -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}── Carousel-only options. Whitelisted; ignored when layout != 'carousel'. ──{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign indicator = content.progress_indicator | default: 'none' -%}
{%- unless indicator == 'none' or indicator == 'scroll_bar' or indicator == 'dots' or indicator == 'stepper' -%}
  {%- assign indicator = 'none' -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- if content.carousel_arrows == nil -%}{%- assign carousel_arrows = true -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign carousel_arrows = content.carousel_arrows -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  cards_per_row accepts fractional values (step 0.5) so carousel mode can peek
  at the next card. Carousel CSS uses calc() and handles fractional cleanly;
  grid mode uses grid-template-columns: repeat() which rejects fractional and
  would silently fall back to a single column. Floor non-carousel viewports
  to keep grid mode valid. List mode ignores cards_per_row.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- unless layout == 'carousel' -%}
  {%- assign cpr_m = cpr_m | floor -%}
  {%- assign cpr_t = cpr_t | floor -%}
  {%- assign cpr_d = cpr_d | floor -%}
{%- endunless -%}

{%- comment -%}── Image aspect-ratio: whitelist, default 1/1 ──{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign aspect = content.image_aspect_ratio | default: '1/1' -%}
{%- unless aspect == '1/1' or aspect == '3/4' or aspect == '4/3' -%}
  {%- assign aspect = '1/1' -%}
{%- endunless -%}

{%- comment -%}── Image object-fit: whitelist, default cover ──{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign fit = content.image_object_fit | default: 'cover' -%}
{%- unless fit == 'cover' or fit == 'contain' -%}
  {%- assign fit = 'cover' -%}
{%- endunless -%}

{%- comment -%}── Image mode: 'single' (default) renders the featured image;
   'carousel' renders all product images (cap 8) as a swipeable strip. ──{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign image_mode = content.image_mode | default: 'single' -%}
{%- unless image_mode == 'single' or image_mode == 'carousel' -%}
  {%- assign image_mode = 'single' -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- if content.show_image_dots == nil -%}{%- assign show_image_dots = true -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign show_image_dots = content.show_image_dots -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign image_dots_position = content.image_dots_position | default: 'center' -%}
{%- unless image_dots_position == 'left' or image_dots_position == 'center' or image_dots_position == 'right' -%}
  {%- assign image_dots_position = 'center' -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- if content.card_hover_swap_image == nil -%}{%- assign card_hover_swap_image = false -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign card_hover_swap_image = content.card_hover_swap_image -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if content.card_hover_shadow == nil -%}{%- assign card_hover_shadow = true -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign card_hover_shadow = content.card_hover_shadow -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}── Title lines: '1'|'2'|'3'|'wrap', default '2' ──{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign title_lines = content.title_lines | default: '2' -%}
{%- unless title_lines == '1' or title_lines == '2' or title_lines == '3' or title_lines == 'wrap' -%}
  {%- assign title_lines = '2' -%}
{%- endunless -%}

{%- comment -%}── Visibility booleans ──{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if content.show_price_label == nil -%}{%- assign show_price_label = false -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign show_price_label = content.show_price_label -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if content.show_current_price == nil -%}{%- assign show_current_price = true -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign show_current_price = content.show_current_price -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if content.show_mrp == nil -%}{%- assign show_mrp = true -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign show_mrp = content.show_mrp -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if content.show_discount == nil -%}{%- assign show_discount = true -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign show_discount = content.show_discount -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if content.show_cta == nil -%}{%- assign show_cta = true -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign show_cta = content.show_cta -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  hide_price_decimals: when true, switch all `| money` calls to
  `money_without_trailing_zeros` so whole-currency prices drop the .00 suffix.
  Fractional prices keep their decimals — Shopify's standard behaviour.
  price_order: sequence of the three price spans inside the price row.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if content.hide_price_decimals == nil -%}{%- assign hide_price_decimals = false -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign hide_price_decimals = content.hide_price_decimals -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign price_order = content.price_order | default: 'current_mrp_discount' -%}
{%- unless price_order == 'current_mrp_discount' or price_order == 'mrp_current_discount' or price_order == 'current_discount_mrp' -%}
  {%- assign price_order = 'current_mrp_discount' -%}
{%- endunless -%}

{%- assign price_label_text = content.price_label_text | default: '' -%}
{%- assign sold_out_label = content.sold_out_label | default: 'Sold Out' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Optional hex overrides for the CTA hover state. Empty string = use the
  default auto-darken in CSS via var() fallback.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign cta_hover_background = content.cta_hover_background | default: '' -%}
{%- assign cta_hover_text_color = content.cta_hover_text_color | default: '' -%}
{%- assign tertiary_cta_hover_background = content.tertiary_cta_hover_background | default: '' -%}
{%- assign tertiary_cta_hover_text_color = content.tertiary_cta_hover_text_color | default: '' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  `cta_label` is read further down with `primary_cta_action` + `enable_mini_pdp`.
  A single label fits every action; the merchant types whatever matches the
  action they picked (e.g. "Add to cart", "Buy now", "View details").
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Swatches: optional row of color dots under each card title. Source data is
  Shopify's product option values; we read `.swatch.color` / `.swatch.image`
  when Shopify exposes them (Online Store 2.0+ with the option set to
  "Color" in admin), otherwise the swatch renders as a neutral disc.
  `swatch_max_visible` is responsive; per-viewport caps are emitted into the
  rendered DOM as `data-hide-m/-t/-d` attributes and resolved by CSS.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if content.show_swatches == nil -%}
  {%- assign show_swatches = false -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign show_swatches = content.show_swatches -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign swatch_option_name = content.swatch_option_name | default: 'Color' -%}
{%- assign swatch_shape = content.swatch_shape | default: 'circle' -%}
{%- unless swatch_shape == 'circle' or swatch_shape == 'square' -%}
  {%- assign swatch_shape = 'circle' -%}
{%- endunless -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Product rating cluster — reads Spectrum's roll-up metafield. Hidden when
  the metafield is absent or totalCount is zero so products without reviews
  don't render a "no rating" placeholder.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if content.show_rating == nil -%}{%- assign show_rating = false -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign show_rating = content.show_rating -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign rating_position = content.rating_position | default: 'title_right' -%}
{%- unless rating_position == 'title_right' or rating_position == 'below_title' -%}
  {%- assign rating_position = 'title_right' -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- if content.rating_show_count == nil -%}{%- assign rating_show_count = false -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign rating_show_count = content.rating_show_count -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}── Swatch caps: same mobile-first cascade as cards_per_row ──{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign smv_raw = content.swatch_max_visible -%}
{%- assign smv_m = smv_raw.mobile -%}
{%- assign smv_t = smv_raw.tablet -%}
{%- assign smv_d = smv_raw.desktop -%}
{%- if smv_m == nil or smv_m == blank -%}{%- assign smv_m = 3 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if smv_t == nil or smv_t == blank -%}{%- assign smv_t = smv_m -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if smv_d == nil or smv_d == blank -%}{%- assign smv_d = smv_t -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if smv_m < 1 -%}{%- assign smv_m = 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if smv_m > 12 -%}{%- assign smv_m = 12 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if smv_t < 1 -%}{%- assign smv_t = 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if smv_t > 12 -%}{%- assign smv_t = 12 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if smv_d < 1 -%}{%- assign smv_d = 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if smv_d > 12 -%}{%- assign smv_d = 12 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign smv_max = smv_m -%}
{%- if smv_t > smv_max -%}{%- assign smv_max = smv_t -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if smv_d > smv_max -%}{%- assign smv_max = smv_d -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Primary CTA behaviour is driven by two independent props:

    - `primary_cta_action` (select) — what the click does. One of:
      `add_to_cart`, `buy_now`, `toggle_wishlist`, `share`,
      `navigate_to_pdp`. Default `add_to_cart` matches the historical
      Mini-PDP-cart-add behaviour.
    - `enable_mini_pdp` (boolean) — whether the Mini-PDP modal block
      renders at all. When off, multi-variant cart-adds redirect to the
      product page; single-variant cart-adds still execute. Default on.

  The Mini-PDP modal is rendered when `enable_mini_pdp` AND the primary
  action *uses* the modal (cart-add or buy-now for multi-variant
  products). Other actions never need the modal.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign primary_cta_action = content.primary_cta_action | default: 'add_to_cart' -%}
{%- unless primary_cta_action == 'add_to_cart' or primary_cta_action == 'buy_now' or primary_cta_action == 'toggle_wishlist' or primary_cta_action == 'share' or primary_cta_action == 'navigate_to_pdp' -%}
  {%- assign primary_cta_action = 'add_to_cart' -%}
{%- endunless -%}

{%- if content.enable_mini_pdp == nil -%}
  {%- assign enable_mini_pdp = true -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign enable_mini_pdp = content.enable_mini_pdp -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Derived flags — see v5vphgd8 for the full explanation. Computed once so
  the CTA, per-card data-script, and modal-block all branch off the same
  booleans.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign cta_intercepts_click = true -%}
{%- if primary_cta_action == 'navigate_to_pdp' -%}{%- assign cta_intercepts_click = false -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- assign cta_emits_theme_atc = false -%}
{%- if primary_cta_action == 'add_to_cart' or primary_cta_action == 'buy_now' -%}
  {%- assign cta_emits_theme_atc = true -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- assign cta_needs_payload = false -%}
{%- if primary_cta_action == 'add_to_cart' or primary_cta_action == 'buy_now' -%}
  {%- assign cta_needs_payload = true -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- assign mini_pdp_will_render = false -%}
{%- if enable_mini_pdp -%}
  {%- if primary_cta_action == 'add_to_cart' or primary_cta_action == 'buy_now' -%}
    {%- assign mini_pdp_will_render = true -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- assign cta_label = content.cta_label | default: 'Add to cart' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Secondary + tertiary CTA props — see v5vphgd8 for the full rationale.
  This is the tab-fork; props + render shape are byte-aligned.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if content.show_secondary_cta == nil -%}{%- assign show_secondary_cta = false -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign show_secondary_cta = content.show_secondary_cta -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign secondary_cta_style = content.secondary_cta_style | default: 'icon_right' -%}
{%- unless secondary_cta_style == 'icon_left' or secondary_cta_style == 'icon_right' or secondary_cta_style == 'text_below' -%}
  {%- assign secondary_cta_style = 'icon_right' -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- assign secondary_cta_action = content.secondary_cta_action | default: 'buy_now' -%}
{%- unless secondary_cta_action == 'add_to_cart' or secondary_cta_action == 'buy_now' or secondary_cta_action == 'toggle_wishlist' or secondary_cta_action == 'share' or secondary_cta_action == 'navigate_to_pdp' -%}
  {%- assign secondary_cta_action = 'buy_now' -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- assign secondary_cta_label = content.secondary_cta_label | default: 'Buy now' -%}
{%- assign secondary_cta_icon_source = content.secondary_cta_icon_source | default: 'preset' -%}
{%- assign secondary_cta_icon_preset = content.secondary_cta_icon_preset | default: 'zap' -%}
{%- assign secondary_cta_icon_custom_url = '' -%}
{%- if content.secondary_cta_icon_custom and content.secondary_cta_icon_custom.originalUrl -%}
  {%- assign secondary_cta_icon_custom_url = content.secondary_cta_icon_custom.originalUrl -%}
{%- elsif content.secondary_cta_icon_custom and content.secondary_cta_icon_custom.previewUrl -%}
  {%- assign secondary_cta_icon_custom_url = content.secondary_cta_icon_custom.previewUrl -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if content.show_tertiary_cta == nil -%}{%- assign show_tertiary_cta = false -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign show_tertiary_cta = content.show_tertiary_cta -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign tertiary_cta_position = content.tertiary_cta_position | default: 'image_top_right' -%}
{%- unless tertiary_cta_position == 'image_top_right' or tertiary_cta_position == 'image_bottom_right' or tertiary_cta_position == 'title_right' -%}
  {%- assign tertiary_cta_position = 'image_top_right' -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- assign tertiary_cta_action = content.tertiary_cta_action | default: 'toggle_wishlist' -%}
{%- unless tertiary_cta_action == 'add_to_cart' or tertiary_cta_action == 'buy_now' or tertiary_cta_action == 'toggle_wishlist' or tertiary_cta_action == 'share' or tertiary_cta_action == 'navigate_to_pdp' -%}
  {%- assign tertiary_cta_action = 'toggle_wishlist' -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- assign tertiary_cta_icon_source = content.tertiary_cta_icon_source | default: 'preset' -%}
{%- assign tertiary_cta_icon_preset = content.tertiary_cta_icon_preset | default: 'heart' -%}
{%- assign tertiary_cta_icon_custom_url = '' -%}
{%- if content.tertiary_cta_icon_custom and content.tertiary_cta_icon_custom.originalUrl -%}
  {%- assign tertiary_cta_icon_custom_url = content.tertiary_cta_icon_custom.originalUrl -%}
{%- elsif content.tertiary_cta_icon_custom and content.tertiary_cta_icon_custom.previewUrl -%}
  {%- assign tertiary_cta_icon_custom_url = content.tertiary_cta_icon_custom.previewUrl -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- capture secondary_icon_svg -%}
  {%- if show_secondary_cta -%}
    {%- if secondary_cta_icon_source == 'preset' -%}
      {%- case secondary_cta_icon_preset -%}
        {%- when 'shopping-cart' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="21" r="1"/><circle cx="19" cy="21" r="1"/><path d="M2.05 2.05h2l2.66 12.42a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.58h9.78a2 2 0 0 0 1.95-1.57l1.65-7.43H5.12"/></svg>
        {%- when 'zap' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
        {%- when 'heart' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.29 1.51 4.04 3 5.5l7 7Z"/></svg>
        {%- when 'share-2' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"/><line x1="8.59" x2="15.42" y1="13.51" y2="17.49"/><line x1="15.41" x2="8.59" y1="6.51" y2="10.49"/></svg>
        {%- when 'eye' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7-10-7-10-7Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
        {%- when 'external-link' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"/><path d="M10 14 21 3"/><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/></svg>
        {%- when 'arrow-right' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        {%- when 'plus' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="M12 5v14"/></svg>
        {%- when 'bookmark' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"/></svg>
